  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Do you do team projects at school?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "I do a lot.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "I enjoy team projects because I like sharing ideas with other people.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Of course, team activities aren't always easy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "You need to know how to work well together.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Here are some suggestions to make team work easier.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Know the goals.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Make sure everyone understands the goal of the project.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "If you're doing a class project, you need to check the teacher's instructions carefully and use a dictionary to help make everything clear.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "There's a popular saying, if you don't know where you're going, you probably won't get there.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Assign roles.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Everyone should have a role in the team.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "There should be a leader who helps everyone make decisions.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "There might be a note-taker who writes things down during meetings.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "And a timekeeper.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "There might also be a group speaker.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Divide the work.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "For large projects, the work can be divided into smaller tasks.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Then you can choose tasks that you do well.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Of course you shouldn't always do the same task even if the new ones are difficult.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Encourage each member to use their talents and try to assign a partner to each person so that somebody can help if anyone is struggling.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Make a plan.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "After you divide the work, write down a plan on paper.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "You can use a calendar to help you.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-24.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "List all the tasks and think about when each one must be finished.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-25.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "It's important for everyone to follow the plan.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-26.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Please communicate via email to keep everyone updated.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-27.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "And don't forget to always cheer each other on.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-28.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
